{
    "player_reason": "Practical and necessary — you called Marcus what he is and distanced yourself from him. Pointing out the real threat and asserting you aren't controlled is useful for staying alive (and keeps me from being lumped in with tadpoled fools). I appreciate the clarity and the self-preserving honesty.",
